# Own starting model, not from an ICDD card (replaces 04-014-5500). Standard YCo6Ge6-type derivation from the
# OQMD 1791584 cell (a = 5.12366, c = 8.15512 A): c halved; Fe 6i z = 0.25070 folds to 0.5014 and is
# placed on 3g (1/2,0,1/2); Ge 2c + 2d fold to 2c (occupancy 1); Ge 2e z = 0.34717 folds to 2e z = 0.30566
# with occupancy 1/2; Gd 1a + empty 1b fold to 1a with occupancy 1/2. Formula Gd0.5Fe3Ge3, Z = 1. Uiso 0.005
# (driver default for partners). DFT (PBE) cell; the driver refines the partner cell within 2 %.

